# Solace Cloud — case-study instance data (PUBLIC ontologies only; blank
# nodes + skos:notation handles, no private namespace). A fictional B2B
# SaaS company undergoing its FIRST SOC2 Type II audit (12-month
# observation period), chosen fictional precisely so this fixture can
# never be read as a real company's compliance claim — the same reasoning
# packs/togaf-adm-pack/templates/meridian-case-study.ttl.tmpl applies to
# Meridian Global Carrier. Concepts are re-asserted here with the SAME
# skos:notation values as packs/soc2-audit-pack/ontology.ttl — notation is
# the deterministic join key across files, since blank-node labels do not
# survive re-serialization (same discipline meridian-case-study.ttl.tmpl
# documents for TOGAF).
#
# COMPLIANCE-OVERCLAIM FENCE: every fact below is an ENGAGEMENT-PROCESS
# fact (scoping decision, evidenced control, phase deliverable) — none of
# it is, or implies, a compliance verdict or auditor opinion. See
# packs/soc2-audit-pack/ontology.ttl for the full fence disclosure.
#
# Scoping decision (a real, plausible business judgment, not arbitrary):
# in-scope TSC categories are Security (mandatory) + Availability +
# Confidentiality — the most common 3-category combination for a B2B
# SaaS. Processing Integrity is OUT OF SCOPE: Solace Cloud does not
# process financial transactions or billing-critical data itself — it
# delegates payment processing to a PCI-compliant third party. Privacy is
# OUT OF SCOPE for this first audit: Solace Cloud plans to add it in a
# future audit cycle once its data-subject-rights tooling matures. Both
# exclusions are real, common, defensible SOC2 scoping patterns.
@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix org:     <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#> .
@prefix prov:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .

_:solace
    rdf:type org:Organization , prov:Agent ;
    skos:notation "ENT-SOLACE-CLOUD" ;
    dcterms:description "Solace Cloud: fictional B2B SaaS company, first SOC2 Type II audit engagement, 12-month observation period. Scoping decision: in-scope TSC categories are Security (mandatory, the Common Criteria) + Availability + Confidentiality — the most common 3-category combination for a B2B SaaS. Processing Integrity is explicitly OUT OF SCOPE (Solace Cloud does not process financial transactions or billing-critical data itself; it delegates payment processing to a PCI-compliant third party). Privacy is explicitly OUT OF SCOPE for this first audit (Solace Cloud plans to add it in a future audit cycle once its data-subject-rights tooling matures)."@en ;
    dcterms:subject "TSC-SECURITY" , "TSC-AVAILABILITY" , "TSC-CONFIDENTIALITY" .

# --- Control points: notated concepts, each a prov:Plan (a documented
# control is a plan for achieving a control objective) linked to exactly
# one TSC category via dcterms:subject. The category value is a literal
# notation string, not a resource link — the same cross-file join
# discipline as skos:notation itself, chosen so the closed-enumeration
# SHACL law (crates/cng/shapes/soc2-shapes.ttl Soc2ControlPointShape) can
# be checked by the SAME generic shape-pattern-violations.rq query every
# other shape law in this crate uses (regex over a literal value), rather
# than requiring a SPARQL-based SHACL target this crate's shape runner
# does not implement.

_:ctrlAccessProvisioning
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Plan ;
    skos:notation "CTRL-ACCESS-PROVISIONING" ;
    dcterms:description "Logical access provisioning and periodic access review for production systems (CC6 Logical and Physical Access Controls)."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo _:solace ;
    dcterms:subject "TSC-SECURITY" .

_:ctrlDrFailoverTest
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Plan ;
    skos:notation "CTRL-DR-FAILOVER-TEST" ;
    dcterms:description "Annual disaster-recovery failover test with documented results (A1.3 requires TESTED recovery procedures, not merely a written plan)."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo _:solace ;
    dcterms:subject "TSC-AVAILABILITY" .

_:ctrlDataClassification
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Plan ;
    skos:notation "CTRL-DATA-CLASSIFICATION" ;
    dcterms:description "Data classification policy applied to customer data stores, distinguishing confidential from public data (C1.1 data classification)."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo _:solace ;
    dcterms:subject "TSC-CONFIDENTIALITY" .

# --- Audit phase executions: each of the 10 lifecycle phases, run for the
# Solace Cloud engagement, typed as both the public taxonomy concept
# (skos:Concept, re-asserting the ontology's notation) and a prov:Activity
# (this phase AS EXECUTED for this engagement), each generating at least
# one deliverable/evidence-artifact entity (prov:Entity).

_:phaseScoping
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Activity ;
    skos:notation "AUDIT-SCOPING" ;
    dcterms:description "Solace Cloud engagement Phase 1: system boundary defined, in-scope TSC categories selected, system description documented."@en ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith _:solace ;
    prov:generated _:delivSystemDescription .
_:delivSystemDescription
    rdf:type prov:Entity ;
    skos:notation "DELIV-SYSTEM-DESCRIPTION" ;
    dcterms:description "System Description document (Phase 1 deliverable)."@en .

_:phaseReadiness
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Activity ;
    skos:notation "AUDIT-READINESS" ;
    dcterms:description "Solace Cloud engagement Phase 2: existing controls inventoried, gap analysis performed against the in-scope criteria."@en ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith _:solace ;
    prov:generated _:delivGapAnalysisReport .
_:delivGapAnalysisReport
    rdf:type prov:Entity ;
    skos:notation "DELIV-GAP-ANALYSIS-REPORT" ;
    dcterms:description "Gap Analysis Report (Phase 2 deliverable)."@en .

_:phaseControlDesignDoc
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Activity ;
    skos:notation "AUDIT-CONTROL-DESIGN-DOC" ;
    dcterms:description "Solace Cloud engagement Phase 3: control narratives drafted, controls mapped to criteria, control matrix finalized."@en ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith _:solace ;
    prov:generated _:delivControlMatrix .
_:delivControlMatrix
    rdf:type prov:Entity ;
    skos:notation "DELIV-CONTROL-MATRIX" ;
    dcterms:description "Control Matrix mapping each control to its TSC criterion (Phase 3 deliverable)."@en .

_:phaseDesignEval
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Activity ;
    skos:notation "AUDIT-DESIGN-EVAL" ;
    dcterms:description "Solace Cloud engagement Phase 4: control design sufficiency reviewed, deficiencies identified, control design approved."@en ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith _:solace ;
    prov:generated _:delivDesignEvalMemo .
_:delivDesignEvalMemo
    rdf:type prov:Entity ;
    skos:notation "DELIV-DESIGN-EVAL-MEMO" ;
    dcterms:description "Control Design Evaluation memo (Phase 4 deliverable)."@en .

_:phaseCollectionInit
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Activity ;
    skos:notation "AUDIT-COLLECTION-INIT" ;
    dcterms:description "Solace Cloud engagement Phase 5: 12-month observation period established, evidence sampling plan configured, collection window opened."@en ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith _:solace ;
    prov:generated _:delivSamplingPlan .
_:delivSamplingPlan
    rdf:type prov:Entity ;
    skos:notation "DELIV-SAMPLING-PLAN" ;
    dcterms:description "Evidence Sampling Plan (Phase 5 deliverable)."@en .

_:phaseOeTesting
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Activity ;
    skos:notation "AUDIT-OE-TESTING" ;
    dcterms:description "Solace Cloud engagement Phase 6: control instances sampled, operating effectiveness tested across the observation period, results recorded."@en ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith _:solace ;
    prov:generated _:delivTestWorkpapers .
_:delivTestWorkpapers
    rdf:type prov:Entity ;
    skos:notation "DELIV-TEST-WORKPAPERS" ;
    dcterms:description "Operating Effectiveness Test Workpapers (Phase 6 deliverable)."@en .

_:phaseExceptionId
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Activity ;
    skos:notation "AUDIT-EXCEPTION-ID" ;
    dcterms:description "Solace Cloud engagement Phase 7: test deviations analyzed, exception severity classified, exception register logged."@en ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith _:solace ;
    prov:generated _:delivExceptionRegister .
_:delivExceptionRegister
    rdf:type prov:Entity ;
    skos:notation "DELIV-EXCEPTION-REGISTER" ;
    dcterms:description "Exception Register (Phase 7 deliverable) — identified exceptions are evidence, not a pass/fail verdict."@en .

_:phaseRemediation
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Activity ;
    skos:notation "AUDIT-REMEDIATION" ;
    dcterms:description "Solace Cloud engagement Phase 8: management response obtained, corrective action implemented, remediation evidence verified."@en ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith _:solace ;
    prov:generated _:delivRemediationLog .
_:delivRemediationLog
    rdf:type prov:Entity ;
    skos:notation "DELIV-REMEDIATION-LOG" ;
    dcterms:description "Management Response & Remediation Log (Phase 8 deliverable)."@en .

_:phaseBundleAssembly
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Activity ;
    skos:notation "AUDIT-BUNDLE-ASSEMBLY" ;
    dcterms:description "Solace Cloud engagement Phase 9: evidence artifacts compiled, cross-referenced to criteria, evidence bundle sealed."@en ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith _:solace ;
    prov:generated _:delivEvidenceBundleManifest .
_:delivEvidenceBundleManifest
    rdf:type prov:Entity ;
    skos:notation "DELIV-EVIDENCE-BUNDLE-MANIFEST" ;
    dcterms:description "Evidence Bundle Manifest (Phase 9 deliverable)."@en .

_:phaseReportHandoff
    rdf:type skos:Concept , prov:Activity ;
    skos:notation "AUDIT-REPORT-HANDOFF" ;
    dcterms:description "Solace Cloud engagement Phase 10 (terminal): evidence bundle packaged and custody transferred to the auditor. No opinion or compliance verdict is produced by this pipeline; the human auditor's professional judgment begins where this deliverable ends."@en ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith _:solace ;
    prov:generated _:delivAuditorHandoffPackage .
_:delivAuditorHandoffPackage
    rdf:type prov:Entity ;
    skos:notation "DELIV-AUDITOR-HANDOFF-PACKAGE" ;
    dcterms:description "Auditor Handoff Package (Phase 10 deliverable — the terminal evidence-bundle-complete artifact)."@en .
